It should convert Twig strings inside a double-quoted attribute to single quotes
<img src="{{ asset("images/logo.png") }}" alt="Logo">

It should convert Twig strings inside a single-quoted attribute and switch the attribute to double quotes
<img src='{{ asset("images/logo.png") }}' alt="Logo">

It should convert nested function call strings
<img src='{{ absolute_url(asset("images/header.png")) }}'>

It should convert strings in tags inside attributes
<div class="card {% if active == "yes" %}card--active{% endif %}"></div>

It should convert strings in several drops inside one attribute
<a href="{{ path("page", { slug: "about" }) }}#{{ anchor ?? "top" }}">About</a>

It should keep double quotes for strings containing single quotes
<img alt="{{ "it's"|trans }}">

It should keep double quotes for interpolated strings
<a href='{{ "#{base}/page" }}'>Page</a>

It should leave strings in Twig comments inside attributes untouched
<div class="a {# "comment" #} b"></div>

It should leave text outside Twig untouched
<div data-json='{"a": "b"}'></div>

It should convert to double quotes when twigSingleQuote is false
twigSingleQuote: false
<img src="{{ asset('images/logo.png') }}" alt="Logo">
